     "body": "<p>So here are the things I discovered while working this.</p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>You need to set the maven-compiler-plugin target argument as a property, so you can change it from 1.8 to 11 when you switch your compiler.</li>\n\t<li>You need to make sure that mvn is using the correct java home (more of a problem in a multi-java setup than in Travis)</li>\n\t<li>You need to disable the javadoc run for the non-1.8 execution as it wants to link to the 1.8 api docs and you are using the 11 api docs. There might be a way around this but I couldn't find it.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p> </p>",
